customCellComponent.description:
A component to render in the cells of this column, and should be a {@link UiSdlDataGridCell} component.
To use SDL presentational inputs out of the box without having to write custom templates, see types.
that extend {@link UiSdlDataGridCell}

title:
A specification that describe how to use each field of the {@link dataType} for display in the {@link UiSdlDataGrid}
or {@link UiSdlFormDataGrid}. A single field is mapped to a single column, so an instance of this type specifies how
to display a single column (and its cells) within a grid.
